### Manual API checks. In IntelliJ, click the ▶ next to each request (app must be running).

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Create a case (run again with the same caseNumber to see the 409 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "C-{{$random.alphanumeric(6)}}",
  "title": "Burglary at 5th Ave"
}

> {% client.global.set("caseId", response.body.id); %}

### Get the case
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cases/{{caseId}}

### Register evidence on the case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cases/{{caseId}}/evidence
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "bodycam-0001.mp4",
  "contentType": "video/mp4",
  "sizeBytes": 104857600,
  "retainUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### List evidence for the case
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cases/{{caseId}}/evidence
